7,21.03 Q10.41,18.48 8.39,16.79 L7.92,16.40 Q2.63,11.99 9.50,11.54 L10.11,11.50 Q12.74,11.32 13.72,8.87 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(80,140,255,0.15)\" stroke-width=\"0.924\" clip-path=\"url(#cl-_R_2alfiv5b_)\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-sans font-bold leading-none tracking-tight\" style=\"font-size:13px\"><span class=\"text-navy\">Earned</span><span class=\"text-gold-dark\">Star</span></span></span></a><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-7 md:flex\"><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/\">Manifesto</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/pricing\">Pricing</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/audit\">The Audit</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink\" href=\"/yotpo-refugees\">Yotpo Refugees</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/reviews/expedia-parts\">Live Store</a><a class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-tight transition-colors text-ink/70 hover:text-ink\" href=\"/design-lab/brand\">Brand</a></div><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 md:flex\"><span class=\"smallcaps hidden text-[10px] lg:inline text-ink/70\">Vol. 01 · 2026</span><a class=\"rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-[13px] font-bold text-ink shadow-sm transition-shadow gold-foil hover:shadow-md\" href=\"/signup\">Start free</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md p-2 md:hidden text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></nav></header><main><section class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-ink pb-32 pt-24 text-white\" data-surface=\"dark\"><div class=\"grain-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-50\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-6 sm:px-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-12\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><span class=\"smallcaps text-[10px] text-gold-light\">For Yotpo refugees</span><h1 class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-5xl leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-balance sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl\">Your Email and SMS just got <span class=\"text-gold-light italic\">deleted</span>.<br/>Move them home in one click.</h1><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/75\">Yotpo turned off native Email and SMS on December 31, 2025. EarnedStar runs reviews, email, SMS, and loyalty on one $99/month plan — and ports your data in one click.</p><div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full px-6 py-3 font-bold text-ink shadow-xl gold-foil\" href=\"/signup\">Migrate in 1 click <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/audit\">Run a free audit first</a></div><div class=\"mt-12 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 backdrop-blur-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert text-gold-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-xs text-white/80\">First 3 months free for Yotpo migrations · No setup fees</span></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-white p-7 text-ink shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"smallcaps text-[10px] text-gold-dark\">Side-by-side</div><h3 class=\"font-heading mt-2 text-3xl\">Then → Now</h3><table class=\"mt-5 w-full text-sm\"><thead><tr class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-ink/70\"><th class=\"py-2 text-left font-bold\">Tool</th><th class=\"py-2 text-right font-bold\">Yotpo era</th><th class=\"py-2 text-right font-bold\">EarnedStar</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"border-t border-ink/8\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink/70\">Reviews</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right text-ink/70\">$199/mo</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right font-bold\">Included</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-ink/8\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink/70\">Email</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right text-ink/70\">$150/mo (Klaviyo)</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right font-bold\">Included</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-ink/8\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink/70\">SMS</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right text-ink/70\">$300/mo (Attentive)</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right font-bold\">Included</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-ink/8\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink/70\">Loyalty</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right text-ink/70\">$49/mo (Smile)</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right font-bold\">Included</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-ink/8\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink/70\">Vendors to manage</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right text-ink/70\">4</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right font-bold\">1</td></tr><tr class=\"border-t border-ink/8\"><td class=\"py-2.5 text-ink/70\">Annual lock-in?</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right text-ink/70\">Yes</td><td class=\"py-2.5 text-right font-bold\">No</td></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"-mx-7 -mb-7 mt-6 rounded-b-2xl bg-ink p-6 text-white\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between\"><div><div class=\"smallcaps text-[10px] text-gold-light\">You save</div><div class=\"font-heading mt-1 text-5xl\">$7,188<span class=\"ml-1 text-base font-normal text-white/60\">/yr</span></div></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"42\" height=\"42\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wallet text-gold-light\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M19 7V4a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H5a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h15a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v4h-3a2 2 0 0 0 0 4h3a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h15a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-4\"></path></svg></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 sm:px-8 lg:px-12\"><span class=\"smallcaps text-[10px] text-gold-dark\">How migration works</span><h2 class=\"font-heading mt-3 text-4xl tracking-tight sm:text-5xl\">Three steps. <span class=\"text-gold-dark italic\">No engineer required.</span></h2><div class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-7 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-combine text-gold-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M14 3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1\"></path><path d=\"M19 3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v5a1 1 0 0 1-1 1\"></path><path d=\"m7 15 3 3\"></path><path d=\"m7 21 3-3H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"></path><rect x=\"14\" y=\"14\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"7\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-ink/70\">STEP · <!-- -->01</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-3xl italic\">Export from Yotpo</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/65\">Paste your Yotpo export CSV into the importer. We auto-map fields including review-trigger flows.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-7 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail text-gold-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-ink/70\">STEP · <!-- -->02</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-3xl italic\">Reconnect your store</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/65\">OAuth into Shopify, Woo, or BigCommerce. EarnedStar reuses order webhooks for verified-purchase flows.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-ink/10 bg-white p-7 transition-shadow hover:shadow-md\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-coins text-gold-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.744 17.736a6 6 0 1 1-7.48-7.48\"></path><path d=\"M15 6h1v4\"></path><path d=\"m6.134 14.768.866-.5 2 3.464\"></path><circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle></svg><span class=\"text-xs font-bold tracking-[0.24em] text-ink/70\">STEP · <!-- -->03</span></div><h3 class=\"font-heading mt-4 text-3xl italic\">Flip the switch</h3><p class=\"mt-3 leading-relaxed text-ink/65\">Pause Klaviyo + Attentive + Yotpo. EarnedMail, EarnedSend, and EarnedLoyalty are already running. First 3 months free.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-y border-ink/10 bg-white py-20\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 gap-8 px-6 sm:px-8 md:grid-cols-4 lg:px-12\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-bold\">3 months free</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-bold\">No setup fees</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-bold\">Field-by-field mapping</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-dark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-bold\">Your data stays portable</span></div></div></section></main><footer class=\"border-t border-border bg-navy text-white\" data-scroll-theme=\"dark\"><section class=\"py-20 text-center\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4\"><h2 class=\"font-display text-3xl italic text-gold\">